   "description": "CRS326-4C+20G+2Q+RM - 20 2.5G RJ45 ports, four combo 2.5G RJ45 / SFP+ ports, two 40G QSFP+ cages, the management jack and the RJ45 console. It has two built-in AC supplies. The box holds two power cords, rack ears and a fastening set.",
